After rearming to 1.035, engaging sets the freeze to 2 and the current profile to Scratch. It calls `hold_profile_and_tier_transitions` targeting the Scratch profile, but it seems the current tier may still be Q1, even after one crossfade. The blend weights are partially leaning toward Q2, which is concerning because `hold_profile_and_tier_transitions` doesn’t snap to Q1 weights. The effective weights remain mixed due to `advance_tier_crossfade` setting, which could create inconsistencies in handling lane weights when they're still in Q1. This is definitely important to fix!
